<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">icABCD2027: 2027 International Conference on Artificial Intelligence, Big Data, Computing and Data Communication Systems</div><div id="cfpvenue">Hilton Mauritius Resort &amp; Spa</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Flic en Flac, Mauritius, July 22-23, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://icabcd.org/2027/" target="_blank">https://icabcd.org/2027/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icabcd2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icabcd2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>November 30, 2026</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=670" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkgreen bg_palegoldenrod">artificial intelligence</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=566026" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkred bg_gray1">big data</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=32906" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkred bg_seagreenlight">computing</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=734548" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkred bg_palegoldenrod">data communication system</span></a></div><p>The <strong>2027 (10th Edition) International Conference on Artificial Intelligence, Big Data, Computing and Data Communication Systems (icABCD)</strong> is a leading conference in the soft computing and communication systems. icABCD 2027 will be held physically at the Hilton Mauritius Resort &amp; Spa, Mauritius. The conference aims at bringing together researchers and practitioners from all over the world working on soft computing, big data technologies, data communication systems and computer security on a common platform so that they can present and discuss emerging ideas and trends in these highly challenging research fields.</p><p>The IEEE Conference Record Number is: <strong>#73136</strong></p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p>All papers must be original and not simultaneously submitted to another journal or conference.</p><p>Authors <strong>MUST anonymise</strong> (remove all contact details from) their papers before submission.</p><p><strong>Format your paper strictly according to the IEEE guidelines provided.</strong></p><p>https://icabcd.org/paper_submission/</p><p>The paper must have a <strong>minimum of 4000 words</strong>. Papers having <strong>more than 8 pages</strong> will carry extra page charges. The maximum number of pages must not exceed 12.</p><p>The submission link is: <a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icabcd2027"><strong>https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icabcd2027</strong></a></p><p><strong>Paper submission deadline: 30th November 2026 (first round)</strong></p><h2>List of Topics</h2><ul><li>Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning </li><li>Communication Technologies</li><li>Information Security &amp; Cybersecurity</li><li>Computer Vision &amp; Robotics</li><li>Software Engineering</li><li>Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering</li><li>ICT in Society and Emerging Trends in Technology</li><li>ICT for Sustainable Development</li><li>AI/ICT in Education</li></ul><h2>Committees</h2><ul><li>Prof. (Dr) Upasana Singh, UKZN, South Africa</li><li>Associate Professor (Dr) Sameerchand Pudaruth, University of Mauritius, Mauritius</li></ul><h2>Publication</h2><p>icABCD2027 proceedings will be submitted for potential publication in the IEEE Xplore Digital Library.</p><h2>Venue</h2><p>The conference will be held on the 22nd and 23rd July 2027 at the Hilton Mauritius Resort &amp; Spa, Flic en Flac, Mauritius.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>All questions about submissions and the conference should be emailed to icabcd.org@gmail.com</p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
